{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的 S09 把“难受时想有人陪”推成“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，对人物动机的解释更极端，失去了 Y 原本较含蓄、开放的表达。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 用【】把每段心理转折突出出来，感受又按音乐进程分时出现，不必同时消化一整堆词，更容易边听边扫、抓住当下重点。它把想念、自我压制、后悔、孤单到最后带着想念继续生活的心理因果链串得更清楚，音乐感受也落到了具体的音色、节奏、身体反应和情绪变化上。个别音乐术语略显专业，S09 的动机解释也稍显过头，但整体的信息组织和细腻程度仍然更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2739c8de-b6cd-4df7-8f36-1735a960334c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T165312737551Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:54:44.665094+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3d1a328d979a29814efb94cdafadb08da0a4f1a9035e365cc82145a44b0a012a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\